  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your winter gear with Rothco's G.I. Glove Liners, proudly made in the U.S.A. Designed to fit seamlessly under D-3A shells and various gloves, these liners offer versatile warmth. The 70% wool and 30% nylon composition ensures superior comfort, breathability, and insulation against the cold. Whether worn as cozy liners or independently as standalone gloves, they deliver reliable performance.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "18958",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your winter gear with Rothco's G.I. Glove Liners, proudly made in the U.S.A. Designed to fit seamlessly under D-3A shells and various gloves, these liners offer versatile warmth. The 70% wool and 30% nylon composition ensures superior comfort, breathability, and insulation against the cold. Whether worn as cozy liners or independently as standalone gloves, they deliver reliable performance. Crafted to Mil-Spec A-A-55119 standards, these glove liners are the perfect addition to your cold-weather essentials, providing unbeatable warmth and enduring quality.</p>",
